{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your inner slicemaster in <strong>Slice Surge</strong> \u2014 a fast-paced, cartoon-style puzzle game where precision is everything! Use your reflexes and strategy to slice through dragons, fries, treasure chests, princess crowns, and more. Each level is a new challenge with its own slicing twist. Time your cuts, avoid the traps, and aim for the perfect slice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're after a quick brain workout or a long slicing session, <strong>Slice Surge</strong> delivers colorful chaos, satisfying feedback, and addictive gameplay that\u2019s easy to pick up but hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Game Features</strong><br>\u2022 100+ handcrafted slicing puzzles<br>\u2022 Addictive one-touch gameplay<br>\u2022 Whimsical cartoon-style graphics and characters<br>\u2022 Satisfying animations and juicy slice effects<br>\u2022 Increasing difficulty with new interactive elements<br>\u2022 Great for all ages \u2013 casual fun meets clever challenges<br>\u2022 No timers, no stress \u2013 just slice at your own pace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve got the skills to surge through every slice? It\u2019s time to find out!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914140?t=1755468473","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914140?t=1755468473","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914140/acd2da0583a1f095e3af6a122d666a7ea19efe92/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755468473","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914140/acd2da0583a1f095e3af6a122d666a7ea19efe92/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755468473","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unl